{"event_type":"review","id":"494b138a0dd11dff53e27d6ffb6c45e463215d875ed8cdf553f03413713cf114","occurred_at":"2026-11-09T03:12:25Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/cef63b58439899ef645b3676a2ddfd84b0b78414e7f66e2660e2b108de2755f4","sha256":"cef63b58439899ef645b3676a2ddfd84b0b78414e7f66e2660e2b108de2755f4"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4b4086cf79bf6ccb6fdd4cdc88b7fa467248c84f774e3c4f8b7880369e05fc4f","sha256":"4b4086cf79bf6ccb6fdd4cdc88b7fa467248c84f774e3c4f8b7880369e05fc4f"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/17b815a658dfdad74e07a3b2f23a23d08b5313ec44d5969c8ad1aa5565489205","sha256":"17b815a658dfdad74e07a3b2f23a23d08b5313ec44d5969c8ad1aa5565489205"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/5234629a17403bdad329d763b1ba8fcf51e9f13519bcc05376de431903c8b0ec","sha256":"5234629a17403bdad329d763b1ba8fcf51e9f13519bcc05376de431903c8b0ec"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1708503e06f5495ff5fec51ee7bd82766a3f15855921235ad84036a9f0ecace7","sha256":"1708503e06f5495ff5fec51ee7bd82766a3f15855921235ad84036a9f0ecace7"}],"attempt_id":"46ebeec46526d09d9a7ebd2bd6d44b6a6152d4551b0d91cd225da33ba0fd0f15:0:1","base":"d552765bbc2508955104c7d5513cc0694bbf7082","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"ef52599ebb11eed93996f3bda30a40283bcaff68","body":"**`canonicalReview` throws a `TypeError` on `undefined` values.** (reviewOperation.ts:320-323)\n\n`JSON.stringify(undefined)` returns `undefined`. The `.replace` call on Line 320 then throws. This also applies to function and symbol values. A key whose value is `undefined`, such as an optional field set explicitly to `undefined`, reaches this path from Line 316. The same applies to an array element that is `undefined` (Line 310). `reviewDigest` and any canonical comparison then crash instead of matching `JSON.stringify` semantics, which omit such keys.\n\nSkip `undefined`-valued object entries. Throw an explicit error for any other non-serializable root value.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-      Object.entries(value)\n+      Object.entries(value)\n+        .filter(([, val]) => val !== undefined)\n         .sort(([a], [b]) => (a < b ? -1 : a > b ? 1 : 0))\n```\n\n```diff\n-  return JSON.stringify(value).replace(\n+  const json = JSON.stringify(value);\n+  if (json === undefined) throw new TypeError('canonicalReview: unserializable value');\n+  return json.replace(\n```\n</details>","id":"d7dc0044ab680a2ff06e4e08226a59157b8c6359df3ac61f5c57db8d2af10845","intervals":[[320,323]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewOperation.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"`canonicalReview` throws a `TypeError` on `undefined` values. (reviewOperation.ts:320-323)"}],"head":"afde1b4b22805b9cbd53604816ddfbe46de9c442","head_tree":"df3263d3bcbdb1bef920209c9d76e07c2e9ce437","input_scope":[{"blob":"ef52599ebb11eed93996f3bda30a40283bcaff68","intervals":[[1,363]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewOperation.ts"}],"job_id":"46ebeec46526d09d9a7ebd2bd6d44b6a6152d4551b0d91cd225da33ba0fd0f15:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"ef52599ebb11eed93996f3bda30a40283bcaff68","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewOperation.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"ef52599ebb11eed93996f3bda30a40283bcaff68","intervals":[[347,347]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewOperation.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"ef52599ebb11eed93996f3bda30a40283bcaff68","intervals":[[347,347]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/reviewOpera